## Phase 11 - API modules (HMS implementation order)

**Rule:** Every module follows the 8-step pattern in `module-creation.mdc`. Each module is a separate, atomic task.

**Scope:** Use the HMS endpoint map in `P010_api_endpoints.mdc` (sections 0-28) and models in `P009_models.mdc`.
**Write-up alignment:** `write-up.md` sections 6, 7, 9, 10, 11, 18.1, 18.3  
**Commercial source alignment:** `hms-frontend/subscription-plan.md` (plan tiers, limits, add-on eligibility, and upgrade suitability logic)
**Primary rules:** `module-creation.mdc`, `architecture.mdc`, `prisma.mdc`, `compliance.mdc`, `testing.mdc`

**Compliance:** All modules must follow `internationalization.mdc` - use translation keys (no hardcoded strings) and add keys to `src/locales/en.json` before completion.

